        UI strings below follow three prefixes:
          action_*  button and menu labels
          cd_*      contentDescription, spoken by TalkBack but never displayed
          <screen>_* everything specific to one screen

        Reuse the shared action_*/cd_* entries rather than adding a second copy of a word like
        "Cancel" per screen — a translator should render it once, and a screen-specific duplicate
        will drift. Anything with a count takes a <plurals>, never string concatenation, because
        other languages have more than two plural forms.
    -->

